            <div class="container px-4 py-5" id="hanging-icons"> 
                <h2 class="pb-2 border-bottom">Project Summary</h2> 
                <div> 
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/flashing_led_bike">555 Timer Based Integrated Circuit Flashing LEDs</a>
                            <p>Utilized a 555 timer IC and 2 groups of 6 LEDs to create an alternating flashing mode</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/concurrency_matrix_multiplication">Concurrency modelling in Python</a>
                            <p>Modelled real-time concurrency control in a multi-threaded environment using matrix multiplication operations. Matrix is a fundamental widely-used data representational format for text, images, audio, and video</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/deadlock_detection_os">Deadlock Detection in a Multi-threaded Enviroment, Python</a>
                            <p>Implemented a Resource Allocation Graph (RAG) model that detects resource contention in multi-threaded enviroments</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/machine_learning/ML_Python">Machine learning (ML) Neuron models and Data Extraction, Python</a>
                            <p>Scope of involvements include Python implementations of Adaptive Linear Neuron (Adaline - Stochastic Gradient Descent), Perceptron, 
                                and data extraction methods (principal component analysis, linear discriminant analysis) on synthetic data, IRIS and MNIST datasets
                            </p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/machine_learning/ML_Pytorch">Multi-Layer Neurons Modelling (Deep Neural Nets) and Regression Analysis, PyTorch</a>
                            <p>Trained multi-layer networks and inferred model prediction accuracy on MNIST dataset and 
                                analysed the correlation level between fuel consumption and auto specifications (model, year, etc.) using neural regression models on Auto MPG dataset</p>
                            
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/research/memory%20p_p">Research, Impact Analysis of Memory Scheduling Policy and Addressing Modes on DRAM Performance and Power Utilization</a>
                            <p>Developed a best-pair simulation method based DRAM operational parameters for buffer management, scheduling policy and its heirarchical structure to compare its power and performance variation levels</p>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <a href="https://github.com/deelorm/deelorm/tree/main/projects/research/cache%20coherence">Research, Cache Cohrence Model for Multi-Core Systems</a>
                            <p>Proposed a dual enclaved scheme, cache coherence model and protocol in a configurable (scalable) enviroment, for mulit-core and distributed systems</p>
                        </li>
